{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_nilah_joy": {
        "attack": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>喜色川流<>：鞭刃近战攻击；她和附近友方英雄受到的回复、护盾+15%。<#ff9028ff>游刃万变<>后<#ffb900ff>4秒<>内，射程+125，攻击扇形顺劈，额外造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>25%<><#ff8a65ff>物理伤害<>，并回复伤害10%的生命。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>纵情逐流<>：穿过血量比例最低的敌方英雄冲刺，落地对周围造成<#ff8a65ff>60<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>45%<><#ff8a65ff>物理伤害<>，<#ffb900ff>2层<>充能。用完后被敌方英雄攻击时放<#ff9028ff>轻纱飞漾<>：<#ffb900ff>2.25秒<>内闪避所有攻击，技能伤害-25%，移速+20%，附近友方英雄同样获得<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>。",
        "ult": "【附加包】等到能卷进多名敌方英雄时旋转鞭刃<#ffb900ff>1秒<>，每段造成<#ff8a65ff>12<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>20%<><#ff8a65ff>物理伤害<>，最后造成<#ff8a65ff>100<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>110%<><#ff8a65ff>物理伤害<>并把周围敌人拉到身边；附近友方英雄回复<#7dd87dff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>30%<>生命并获得<#7dd87dff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>30%<>护盾。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_nilah_joy": {
        "attack": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>樂無止境<>：鞭刃近戰攻擊；她和附近友方英雄受到的回復、護盾+15%。<#ff9028ff>百變之刃<>後<#ffb900ff>4秒<>內，射程+125，攻擊扇形順劈，額外造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>25%<><#ff8a65ff>物理傷害<>，並回復傷害10%的生命。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>湍流淩步<>：穿過血量比例最低的敵方英雄衝刺，落地對周圍造成<#ff8a65ff>60<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>45%<><#ff8a65ff>物理傷害<>，<#ffb900ff>2層<>充能。用完後被敵方英雄攻擊時放<#ff9028ff>歡躍面紗<>：<#ffb900ff>2.25秒<>內閃避所有攻擊，技能傷害-25%，跑速+20%，附近友方英雄同樣獲得<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>。",
        "ult": "【附加包】等到能捲進多名敵方英雄時旋轉鞭刃<#ffb900ff>1秒<>，每段造成<#ff8a65ff>12<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>20%<><#ff8a65ff>物理傷害<>，最後造成<#ff8a65ff>100<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>110%<><#ff8a65ff>物理傷害<>並把周圍敵人拉到身邊；附近友方英雄回復<#7dd87dff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>30%<>生命並獲得<#7dd87dff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>30%<>護盾。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_nilah_joy": {
        "attack": "[Add-on] <#ff9028ff>Joy Unending<>: melee whip-blade attacks; heals and shields on her and nearby allied champions are 15% stronger. For <#ffb900ff>4s<> after <#ff9028ff>Formless Blade<> they reach 125 farther, cut a cone for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>25%<> more <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<> and heal her for 10% of the damage.",
        "skill2": "[Add-on] <#ff9028ff>Slipstream<>: dashes through the lowest enemy champion, dealing <#ff8a65ff>60<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>45%<> <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<> around her landing; <#ffb900ff>2 charges<>. With both spent and an enemy champion hitting her, <#ff9028ff>Jubilant Veil<>: for <#ffb900ff>2.25s<> she dodges every attack, takes 25% less from abilities and gains 20% move speed; nearby allied champions get the same for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "ult": "[Add-on] Once it can catch several enemy champions, spins her whip-blade for <#ffb900ff>1s<>, dealing <#ff8a65ff>12<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>20%<> <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<> a hit, then <#ff8a65ff>100<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>110%<> <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<> and pulls nearby enemies to her; nearby allied champions heal <#7dd87dff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>30%<> and gain a <#7dd87dff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>30%<> shield."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_nilah_joy": {
        "attack": "[애드온] <#ff9028ff>영원한 기쁨<>: 채찍검 근접 공격; 자신과 주변 아군 챔피언이 받는 회복·보호막 +15%. <#ff9028ff>무형의 검<> 후 <#ffb900ff>4초<> 동안 사거리 +125, 공격이 부채꼴로 베어 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>25%<> <#ff8a65ff>물리 피해<>를 추가로 주고 피해의 10%만큼 회복.",
        "skill2": "[애드온] <#ff9028ff>급류<>: 체력 비율이 가장 낮은 적 챔피언을 관통해 돌진, 착지 지점 주변에 <#ff8a65ff>60<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>45%<> <#ff8a65ff>물리 피해<>, <#ffb900ff>2회<> 충전. 모두 쓰고 적 챔피언에게 공격받으면 <#ff9028ff>승리의 장막<>: <#ffb900ff>2.25초<> 동안 모든 공격 회피, 스킬 피해 -25%, 이동 속도 +20%; 주변 아군 챔피언도 <#ffb900ff>1.5초<> 동안 같은 효과.",
        "ult": "[애드온] <#ffb900ff>1초<> 동안 (적 챔피언 여럿이 들어올 때) 채찍검을 돌려 <#ff8a65ff>12<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>20%<> <#ff8a65ff>물리 피해<>를 반복, 마지막에 <#ff8a65ff>100<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>110%<> <#ff8a65ff>물리 피해<>를 주고 주변 적을 끌어당김; 주변 아군 챔피언은 <#7dd87dff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>30%<> 회복, <#7dd87dff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>30%<> 보호막."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_nilah_joy": {
        "attack": "【アドオン】<#ff9028ff>終わりなき喜び<>：鞭刃の近接攻撃；自身と周囲の味方チャンピオンが受ける回復・シールド+15%。<#ff9028ff>形なき刃<>の後<#ffb900ff>4秒<>、射程+125、扇状に斬り<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>25%<>の<#ff8a65ff>物理ダメージ<>を追加、与ダメージの10%回復。",
        "skill2": "【アドオン】<#ff9028ff>流撃<>：体力割合が最も低い敵チャンピオンを突き抜けてダッシュ、着地点の周囲に<#ff8a65ff>60<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>45%<>の<#ff8a65ff>物理ダメージ<>、<#ffb900ff>2回<>チャージ。使い切って敵チャンピオンに攻撃されると<#ff9028ff>歓喜のヴェール<>：<#ffb900ff>2.25秒<>全ての通常攻撃を回避、スキルダメージ-25%、移動速度+20%、周囲の味方も<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>同じ効果。",
        "ult": "【アドオン】<#ffb900ff>1秒<>複数の敵チャンピオンを巻き込める時に鞭刃を回し<#ff8a65ff>12<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>20%<>の<#ff8a65ff>物理ダメージ<>を繰り返し、最後に<#ff8a65ff>100<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>110%<>の<#ff8a65ff>物理ダメージ<>と周囲の敵を引き寄せる；周囲の味方は<#7dd87dff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>30%<>回復、<#7dd87dff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>30%<>のシールド。"
      }
    }
  }
}
